{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（29日）早上7時12分，警方接報，葵涌貨櫃碼頭南路1號迴旋處，一輛貨車與電單車相撞，電單車司機及乘客報稱受傷。救援人員到場為傷者治療，有傷者被抬上擔架床並須戴上頸箍，其後被送往瑪嘉烈醫院治理。</p><p>現場消息指，事發時貨車及電單車駛至上址迴旋處，期間電單車切線，貨車收掣不及於是撞及。其他駕駛者見狀落地幫忙。</p><figure><img alt=\"電單車男乘客受傷。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148171597232738304716532.jpeg/hWWJdMRbOQqAQedxeeO8wxNVW2ZILXxBhZ1jbaCdY20\"/><figcaption>電單車男乘客受傷。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"救援人員為傷者治療。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148171512591683584861435.jpeg/X3dml-X0ad2OxqgPZaLvYI6tfWsDXq-U52QFGsJkBRo\"/><figcaption>救援人員為傷者治療。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"電單車男乘客受傷。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148171515632685056385249.jpeg/ooKafU7xMtaSlNhMi79p5nW3rtQNlYbVH3QA7Tp0AO0\"/><figcaption>電單車男乘客受傷。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是貨櫃碼頭南路1號迴旋處。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148171518426222592691758.jpeg/NXzwnCsYq1CS1HVEdQ6f5R1vVB0Kr2yHihmHEq8ZhxI\"/><figcaption>現場是貨櫃碼頭南路1號迴旋處。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"貨車司機協助調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148171521328812032137429.jpeg/-J9BlsucLZxphXix7hx-FILoxnEyu5whieQzxazkM8U\"/><figcaption>貨車司機協助調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"電單車司機協助調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148171524168486912705218.jpeg/2uRq3vQ2qT5aMt77VJ7f8ztMr8rEyyUBXECJwnlAicI\"/><figcaption>電單車司機協助調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-29T00:19:57.974741+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":258,"images":6,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}